# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Keeps the Docker build context small and prevents local secrets / build
# artifacts from ever being baked into an image layer.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

node_modules
npm-debug.log*

# Next.js build output (regenerated inside the image)
.next
out

# Env files — never bake secrets into an image; pass them at `docker run`
# time via --env-file instead (see .env.docker.example)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Git
.git
.gitignore

# Editor / OS
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Docs & misc project files not needed to build the app
README.md
*.md
supabase
scripts

# Docker files themselves (no need to COPY them into the image)
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
